sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Cliente
    participant G as erp-gateway
    participant P as erp-people
    participant DB as MariaDB
    participant JWT as JWT Service

    C->>G: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{identifier, password}
    G->>P: Axios POST /api/auth/login
    P->>DB: SELECT usuario + roles
    DB-->>P: Usuario encontrado
    P->>P: bcrypt.compare(password)
    P->>JWT: generateAccessToken()
    P->>JWT: generateRefreshToken()
    JWT-->>P: tokens
    P->>DB: UPDATE refresh_token_hash
    P-->>G: {accessToken, refreshToken, usuario}
    G-->>C: 200 OK + tokens
